  "prompt": "Cho hình chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có đáy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là một hình bình hành. Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là điểm thuộc cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Đường thẳng đi qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> và song song với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cắt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>. Chứng minh\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
